{
    "title": "FM Radio, Live FM, Live radio",
    "description": "<b>Discover More than 20,000 US Radio stations and listen to the Live FM& AM Radio for free</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 <b>City-Specific Channels: </b>\r\nDive into stations from major cities including  New York, Chicago, Los Angeles,San Francisco, Boston, Washington D.C., Houston, Atlanta and more. Feel the unique vibes of each locale.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfb<b>Hot Stations at Your Fingertips: </b>\r\nFOX News, WSKQ La Mega 97.9, WHTZ Z100, WSCR - 670 AM The Score, WCBS 880, 1010 WINS CBS New York, Jazz24, BBC World Service, ESPN Radio,WQHT Hot 97 FM, 70's 80's country music radio and Instant access to Christmas  music stations\r\n\r\nFM Radio is a radio tuner that offers 50000 radio stations all around the world, include local radio station. With simple and elegant design, Free FM Radio - AM Radio, Live FM & Radio station gives you the genre such as news radio, talk radio, sport radios, and it totally free to listen music radio: hip hop, rock, pop, country, classic and so on.\r\n\r\nFM Radio supports FM, AM radio station, you can easily search the live radio and online radio, then one-click to play.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n\u2b50Alarm clock: set alarm for your favorite radio station\r\n\u2b50Sleep timer: when you sleep and listen the live radio FM Radio will auto off at the time you set.\r\n\u2b50Accurate search: you can search the online radio, AM radio, FM radio by the tag, name and location.\r\n\u2b50Favorite the radio station: Add the live radio to your favorite list, and play quickly the next time.\r\nPlay control: Easily play/stop the radio.\r\n\u2b50Car mode: A mode optimized for car usage, It simplifies the interface, improves the ease of use.\r\n\u2b50Android Auto support: Use FM radio app with Android Auto for easier use while driving.\r\n\r\nFM Radio is really a great app to listen am fm radio and local radio.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Discover More than 20,000 US Radio stations and listen to the Live FM&amp; AM Radio for free</b><br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 <b>City-Specific Channels: </b><br>Dive into stations from major cities including  New York, Chicago, Los Angeles,San Francisco, Boston, Washington D.C., Houston, Atlanta and more. Feel the unique vibes of each locale.<br><br>\ud83d\udcfb<b>Hot Stations at Your Fingertips: </b><br>FOX News, WSKQ La Mega 97.9, WHTZ Z100, WSCR - 670 AM The Score, WCBS 880, 1010 WINS CBS New York, Jazz24, BBC World Service, ESPN Radio,WQHT Hot 97 FM, 70&#39;s 80&#39;s country music radio and Instant access to Christmas  music stations<br><br>FM Radio is a radio tuner that offers 50000 radio stations all around the world, include local radio station. With simple and elegant design, Free FM Radio - AM Radio, Live FM &amp; Radio station gives you the genre such as news radio, talk radio, sport radios, and it totally free to listen music radio: hip hop, rock, pop, country, classic and so on.<br><br>FM Radio supports FM, AM radio station, you can easily search the live radio and online radio, then one-click to play.<br><br><b>Key Features:</b><br>\u2b50Alarm clock: set alarm for your favorite radio station<br>\u2b50Sleep timer: when you sleep and listen the live radio FM Radio will auto off at the time you set.<br>\u2b50Accurate search: you can search the online radio, AM radio, FM radio by the tag, name and location.<br>\u2b50Favorite the radio station: Add the live radio to your favorite list, and play quickly the next time.<br>Play control: Easily play/stop the radio.<br>\u2b50Car mode: A mode optimized for car usage, It simplifies the interface, improves the ease of use.<br>\u2b50Android Auto support: Use FM radio app with Android Auto for easier use while driving.<br><br>FM Radio is really a great app to listen am fm radio and local radio.",
